<title>CYPRUS: Universal Savings 96 op.profit up 62pct.</title>
<headline>Universal Savings 96 op.profit up 62pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(In thousands of Cyprus pounds unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit			365.35     225.13</p>
<p>Profit before provisions for bad</p>
<p>    debts				     116.90	84.77</p>
<p>    Provisions for bad debts	     67.00	31.86</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			49.90	52.90</p>
<p>    Tax					   1.03	11.21</p>
<p>Year's profit attributable to</p>
<p>    shareholders			     48.86	41.69</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (cents)	     2.2	  2.7</p>
<p>Total of loans and other grants</p>
<p>before the provision for bad</p>
<p>    debts				   6,277.61     3,132.57</p>
<p>    Total provision for bad debts   (108.86)	(41.86)</p>
<p>						---------------------</p>
<p>						6,168.75     3,090.71</p>
<p>Provisions for bad debts as a</p>
<p>percentage of loans and other</p>
<p>    grants to clients		     1.7%	    1.3%</p>
<p>Deposits and other accounts of</p>
<p>    customers			     4,923.63     1,990.63</p>
<p>Note : Full company name is Universal Savings Bank Limited.</p>
<p>The company announced it plans to increase its capital base by 1.0 million pounds to 5.0 million pounds through a rights issue.</p>
<p>The shares will be issued in the ratio of 1 for every four held, while the new capital will be used to finance the extension of the bank's network of branches in Cyprus.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
